answers.workaround:
Currently you can either Input.get_axis() 3 times or Input.get_vector() and Input.get_axis() for the third axis.
```gdscript
var horizontal_input : Vector2 = Input.get_vector("fly_left","fly_right","fly_forward","fly_back")
var vertical_input : float = Input.get_axis("fly_down","fly_up")
var combined_input = Vector3(horizontal_input.x, vertical_input, horizontal_input.y)
transform.origin += combined_input 
```
